Why Use the / Operator Instead of String Concatenation? ​Cross-Platform Compatibility: Windows uses \ for directories while macOS/Linux use /. Hand-typed slashes lock code to a single operating system. ​Universal Execution: Path("data") / "log.txt" evaluates correctly on your local laptop, laboratory machines, and automated grading environments. ​2. File Structure & Glob Patterns 

